1
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:08,649
♪Beneath the mask♪

2
00:00:08,691 --> 00:00:12,210
♪Lies another mask♪
(Original Story: Haishi Lisheng)

3
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:15,359
♪Who's sincere♪

4
00:00:15,401 --> 00:00:18,970
♪Who's only pretending♪

5
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:21,929
♪Borrowing your light♪

6
00:00:21,971 --> 00:00:26,370
♪I walk through my own night♪

7
00:00:26,690 --> 00:00:28,309
♪You are my weakness♪

8
00:00:28,351 --> 00:00:29,839
♪And my weapon too♪

9
00:00:29,881 --> 00:00:31,329
♪Draped in your shadow♪

10
00:00:31,371 --> 00:00:33,210
♪I walk the blade's edge♪

11
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:35,179
♪If one day♪

12
00:00:35,221 --> 00:00:36,789
♪The mask shatters♪

13
00:00:36,831 --> 00:00:38,239
♪Will you still♪

14
00:00:38,281 --> 00:00:42,439
♪Recognize my light♪

15
00:00:42,481 --> 00:00:44,460
=The Masked Lover=

16
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:55,860
=Episode 17=

17
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:03,000
Yutang.

18
00:01:03,520 --> 00:01:04,840
Still awake this late?

19
00:01:05,070 --> 00:01:05,870
Father.

20
00:01:06,150 --> 00:01:07,560
What brings you here so late?

21
00:01:07,790 --> 00:01:09,560
Worried I won't do well
as tomorrow's guide?

22
00:01:09,840 --> 00:01:11,179
No.

23
00:01:11,221 --> 00:01:11,489
Come.

24
00:01:11,531 --> 00:01:12,179
Sit down.

25
00:01:12,221 --> 00:01:13,510
I need to discuss something important.

26
00:01:16,640 --> 00:01:17,510
Go ahead, Father.

27
00:01:18,950 --> 00:01:20,000
Yutang.

28
00:01:20,920 --> 00:01:22,790
If you pull this off,

29
00:01:23,200 --> 00:01:26,510
I'll give you half of everything
the Lu family owns.

30
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:29,400
As for the other half...

31
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:31,070
it'll be yours sooner or later.

32
00:01:33,510 --> 00:01:35,790
You've always rewarded people on merit.

33
00:01:35,950 --> 00:01:36,870
So I'm not worried.

34
00:01:38,840 --> 00:01:39,560
Where's the governor?

35
00:01:39,680 --> 00:01:41,120
The governor's gone to Ms. Lu's room.

36
00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:43,920
All right.

37
00:01:47,040 --> 00:01:47,840
Yutang.

38
00:01:49,310 --> 00:01:51,000
I should have a son.

39
00:01:52,070 --> 00:01:53,760
Of course you should, Father.

40
00:01:58,560 --> 00:01:59,150
Yutang.

41
00:01:59,840 --> 00:02:01,280
Bear me a son.

42
00:02:02,430 --> 00:02:03,590
Father, what are you saying?

43
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:05,560
Yutang.

44
00:02:06,040 --> 00:02:07,289
Bear me a son,

45
00:02:07,331 --> 00:02:09,360
and my entire estate is yours!

46
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:12,099
Father.

47
00:02:12,141 --> 00:02:12,689
Father!

48
00:02:12,731 --> 00:02:14,099
You said I'd be
the Lu family's daughter,

49
00:02:14,141 --> 00:02:14,979
your daughter, Father.

50
00:02:15,021 --> 00:02:15,569
Listen to me.

51
00:02:15,611 --> 00:02:16,800
Just listen!

52
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:20,150
Once the child is born, we'll say
the Fourteenth Concubine is the mother.

53
00:02:20,310 --> 00:02:21,449
You'll still be Ms. Lu.

54
00:02:21,491 --> 00:02:22,849
I'll still be your father.

55
00:02:22,891 --> 00:02:24,000
You'll simply have a younger brother!

56
00:02:24,280 --> 00:02:24,979
Besides,

57
00:02:25,021 --> 00:02:26,219
I've done so much for you.

58
00:02:26,261 --> 00:02:28,470
You should repay me.

59
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:33,449
Father!

60
00:02:33,491 --> 00:02:34,280
Listen to me.

61
00:02:34,430 --> 00:02:36,360
Just do as I say.

62
00:02:36,470 --> 00:02:37,519
Bear me a son,

63
00:02:37,561 --> 00:02:38,630
and the entire estate will be yours.

64
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:39,750
Once you give me a son,

65
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:41,840
I swear I'll never touch you again.

66
00:02:42,470 --> 00:02:44,059
Let go of me!

67
00:02:44,101 --> 00:02:45,030
No!

68
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:46,129
Don't you like He Jingchen?

69
00:02:46,171 --> 00:02:46,729
No!

70
00:02:46,771 --> 00:02:47,870
I'll marry you to him.

71
00:02:47,960 --> 00:02:50,240
Any other man in Fancheng is fine.

72
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:52,030
Just give me a son!

73
00:02:52,870 --> 00:02:53,779
Let go!

74
00:02:53,821 --> 00:02:55,009
Let go of me!

75
00:02:55,051 --> 00:02:55,800
Help!

76
00:02:57,150 --> 00:02:58,150
Let go of me!

77
00:02:58,840 --> 00:02:59,520
No!

78
00:03:05,840 --> 00:03:06,870
Let go of me!

79
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:09,379
The governor is in Ms. Lu's room.

80
00:03:09,421 --> 00:03:09,819
Help!

81
00:03:09,861 --> 00:03:10,630
Commander He!

82
00:03:10,910 --> 00:03:12,470
The governor and Ms. Lu
are discussing something important.

83
00:03:12,590 --> 00:03:13,750
He ordered that no one go near them.

84
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:14,590
Help!

85
00:03:15,120 --> 00:03:15,910
Move.

86
00:03:16,750 --> 00:03:17,560
No!

87
00:03:20,030 --> 00:03:20,840
Let go of me!

88
00:03:27,710 --> 00:03:28,520
Let go!

89
00:03:31,430 --> 00:03:33,960
No!

90
00:03:35,030 --> 00:03:35,659
Please!

91
00:03:35,701 --> 00:03:36,360
Governor.

92
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:37,470
Get out!

93
00:03:38,190 --> 00:03:39,960
What could be so urgent it can't wait?

94
00:03:40,430 --> 00:03:41,870
It's about Young Master Rong.

95
00:04:00,120 --> 00:04:00,960
Speak.

96
00:04:02,430 --> 00:04:03,190
Young Master Rong

97
00:04:03,430 --> 00:04:05,360
fell for Ms. Lu at first sight today.

98
00:04:06,310 --> 00:04:07,849
I believe

99
00:04:07,891 --> 00:04:09,000
Ms. Lu can offer you far more

100
00:04:09,470 --> 00:04:11,910
than just bearing you a child.

101
00:04:15,590 --> 00:04:16,680
Is that true?

102
00:04:16,920 --> 00:04:17,750
Yes.

103
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:50,489
Don't be afraid.

104
00:04:50,531 --> 00:04:51,360
I'll get you out of here.

105
00:05:47,680 --> 00:05:48,480
It's over now.

106
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:50,560
You're safe here.

107
00:05:50,830 --> 00:05:52,070
What exactly happened today?

108
00:05:52,870 --> 00:05:54,160
Why did Iron Leopard suddenly...

109
00:06:00,480 --> 00:06:01,270
Don't worry.

110
00:06:02,800 --> 00:06:03,830
There won't be a next time.

111
00:06:07,390 --> 00:06:08,190
I'm sorry.

112
00:06:09,630 --> 00:06:11,360
I failed to protect you.

113
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:29,040
I've got hot water ready.

114
00:06:30,040 --> 00:06:31,630
If you want to take a hot bath...

115
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:34,630
Don't worry.

116
00:06:34,750 --> 00:06:35,600
Tonight,

117
00:06:36,510 --> 00:06:37,870
no one can get near this place.

118
00:06:38,830 --> 00:06:40,000
I'll stand guard in the outer room.

119
00:06:41,070 --> 00:06:42,160
If you need anything,

120
00:06:42,920 --> 00:06:43,750
call for me anytime.

121
00:07:11,240 --> 00:07:12,040
I found out what happened.

122
00:07:12,310 --> 00:07:14,360
The new Dr. Hu put the idea in his head.

123
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:18,160
Iron Leopard thinks Feng Yanyan's maid
will never bear him a son.

124
00:07:18,510 --> 00:07:20,390
So he set his sights on his daughter.

125
00:07:21,430 --> 00:07:22,369
That means...

126
00:07:22,411 --> 00:07:24,459
That means
he must've known for some time

127
00:07:24,501 --> 00:07:25,870
she isn't really Ms. Lu.

128
00:07:29,000 --> 00:07:30,360
How do you think he found out?

129
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:35,750
That old fox really is crafty.

130
00:07:37,270 --> 00:07:39,830
That's why we've stayed hidden so long.

131
00:07:41,310 --> 00:07:42,870
We can't afford many failures.

132
00:07:44,560 --> 00:07:46,240
Iron Leopard is desperate for a son.

133
00:07:46,510 --> 00:07:48,070
How did you get her out?

134
00:07:58,600 --> 00:07:59,680
Are you crazy?

135
00:08:02,950 --> 00:08:05,600
When did Rong Muxian ever
fall for her at first sight?

136
00:08:06,270 --> 00:08:08,190
You're backing yourself into a corner.

137
00:08:08,310 --> 00:08:09,800
It was an emergency.

138
00:08:10,120 --> 00:08:11,310
That was the only way

139
00:08:11,510 --> 00:08:12,830
to make him give up.

140
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:15,310
We'll adjust tomorrow's plan slightly.

141
00:08:15,630 --> 00:08:16,430
At first light,

142
00:08:17,120 --> 00:08:18,929
Su Yutang

143
00:08:18,971 --> 00:08:21,920
will still show Rong Muxian around.

144
00:08:22,720 --> 00:08:23,950
Once they reach the granary,

145
00:08:24,310 --> 00:08:26,360
have the bandits abduct them both.

146
00:08:27,430 --> 00:08:29,190
After what she's been through,

147
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:31,190
can she even go out tomorrow?

148
00:08:35,030 --> 00:08:35,910
I believe she can.

149
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:38,720
But

150
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:40,670
after this,

151
00:08:41,240 --> 00:08:42,720
she can't stay at
the Governor's Residence anymore.

152
00:08:43,670 --> 00:08:45,510
We're ending our partnership with her.

153
00:08:48,150 --> 00:08:51,150
Either way, you took too big a risk.

154
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:54,510
If Lu Zhentian finds out it isn't true,

155
00:08:54,630 --> 00:08:56,459
he'll know you lied to him.

156
00:08:56,501 --> 00:08:58,529
All the trust you've built up

157
00:08:58,571 --> 00:08:59,840
will go to waste.

158
00:09:00,790 --> 00:09:02,600
Rong Muxian will have been abducted.

159
00:09:02,870 --> 00:09:04,200
How would Lu Zhentian know?

160
00:09:04,510 --> 00:09:05,729
You won't kill Rong Muxian.

161
00:09:05,771 --> 00:09:07,240
Won't you have to let him go eventually?

162
00:09:08,360 --> 00:09:09,390
We'll take it one step at a time.

163
00:09:14,030 --> 00:09:15,750
You're always several moves ahead.

164
00:09:16,360 --> 00:09:18,720
Taking it one step at a time
isn't your style.

165
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:25,200
She's earned Lu Zhentian's favor,

166
00:09:25,440 --> 00:09:26,750
and she thinks fast on her feet.

167
00:09:27,870 --> 00:09:29,270
Wouldn't it be a shame

168
00:09:29,440 --> 00:09:30,670
to just let her go?

169
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:32,339
Besides,

170
00:09:32,381 --> 00:09:34,600
you no longer have Lu Shaoyun
as a weapon.

171
00:09:35,550 --> 00:09:37,369
Right now,

172
00:09:37,411 --> 00:09:39,480
she's the best weapon you've got.

173
00:09:39,870 --> 00:09:40,670
No.

174
00:09:41,870 --> 00:09:43,270
She's not like Lu Shaoyun.

175
00:09:44,120 --> 00:09:45,150
She's not someone I'll sacrifice.

176
00:09:46,080 --> 00:09:50,150
If any of us is ever in danger,
we pull out.

177
00:09:50,440 --> 00:09:51,320
That's nothing to regret.

178
00:09:52,600 --> 00:09:53,670
But I think it is.

179
00:09:56,270 --> 00:09:57,080
I'm not quitting.

180
00:09:57,480 --> 00:09:58,670
And I have a better plan.

181
00:09:58,870 --> 00:09:59,960
You two should hear me out.

182
00:10:00,200 --> 00:10:01,000
No.

183
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:03,910
Lu Zhentian
is too dangerous for you now.

184
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:06,270
You can't stay at
the Governor's Residence anymore.

185
00:10:07,440 --> 00:10:10,750
Tomorrow, just show Rong Muxian around.

186
00:10:11,270 --> 00:10:12,840
Once our men abduct you both,

187
00:10:12,960 --> 00:10:13,840
I'll send you away.

188
00:10:14,030 --> 00:10:14,630
I'm not leaving.

189
00:10:15,320 --> 00:10:16,750
I'll still pay you what I promised.

190
00:10:17,080 --> 00:10:18,000
He Jingchen.

191
00:10:18,270 --> 00:10:19,939
Do you still think I agreed
to work with you

192
00:10:19,981 --> 00:10:21,200
just for money?

193
00:10:27,200 --> 00:10:29,670
Even if you joined me
to avenge your friend,

194
00:10:30,750 --> 00:10:32,720
haven't you done that already?

195
00:10:32,840 --> 00:10:34,200
What about Xu Lili and Rong?

196
00:10:34,870 --> 00:10:36,960
What about those eleven poor women
in the back courtyard?

197
00:10:37,270 --> 00:10:38,910
And the countless people of Fancheng?

198
00:10:39,150 --> 00:10:40,179
And all the happy families

199
00:10:40,221 --> 00:10:42,369
opium is about to tear apart?

200
00:10:42,411 --> 00:10:43,270
And...

201
00:10:46,270 --> 00:10:48,750
And me. Lu Zhentian nearly
forced himself on me.

202
00:10:52,440 --> 00:10:54,510
So now, we want the same thing.

203
00:10:55,390 --> 00:10:57,150
You know what I want?

204
00:11:01,790 --> 00:11:03,480
I just heard your conversation.

205
00:11:04,630 --> 00:11:06,360
You said I wasn't someone you'd
sacrifice.

206
00:11:06,480 --> 00:11:08,600
And you wouldn't even kill
the opium king's son.

207
00:11:08,750 --> 00:11:10,120
So I don't think you're a bad guy.

208
00:11:13,030 --> 00:11:13,649
All right.

209
00:11:13,691 --> 00:11:14,529
At a time like this,

210
00:11:14,571 --> 00:11:15,510
stop arguing.

211
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:17,000
Come. Sit.

212
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:18,320
Let's hear this better plan of yours.

213
00:11:40,320 --> 00:11:44,230
♪A lie carved deep into the heart♪
(Loyalty Eternal)

214
00:11:46,280 --> 00:11:49,619
♪Blades clash, leaving us both trapped♪

215
00:11:49,661 --> 00:11:52,290
♪Nightmares from days gone by♪

216
00:11:53,790 --> 00:11:55,349
♪Love and hate intertwine♪

217
00:11:55,391 --> 00:11:59,490
♪In eyes ignited by sparks♪

218
00:12:00,030 --> 00:12:05,440
♪Each blooming with a fierce edge♪

219
00:12:07,030 --> 00:12:10,349
♪Shattering moonlight on the ground♪

220
00:12:10,391 --> 00:12:13,699
♪I look up and meet your gaze♪

221
00:12:13,741 --> 00:12:16,259
♪Unveiling all the absurdity♪

222
00:12:16,301 --> 00:12:19,280
♪Seeking love's only truth♪

223
00:12:19,550 --> 00:12:25,800
♪Through fate's layered maze♪

224
00:12:26,290 --> 00:12:29,599
♪Charging toward the unknown♪

225
00:12:29,641 --> 00:12:32,829
♪Don't forget your stubborn heart♪

226
00:12:32,871 --> 00:12:39,599
♪Fire tempers the strength to go on♪

227
00:12:39,641 --> 00:12:42,849
♪Counting down the long night's haze♪

228
00:12:42,891 --> 00:12:46,289
♪With my own hands, I draw the dawn♪

229
00:12:46,331 --> 00:12:48,450
♪Boundless♪
